From: mscharged-port
Subject: Native compiler contracts of the original online scenes
Upstream-base: 9046e67aa2077a7eb4ed6e28c9df3c1d3b368f84
Classification: native compiler contract; no game behavior change.

Retail MWCC emits header inline functions out of line, so units that see only
a declaration still link. GCC emits no out-of-line copy, which left the module
importing symbols nothing defines, as in the Challenge preview (0621).

- SHOnlineMiiSelectOverlay.cpp includes the unchanged inline bodies of
  fn_801CA660 (GameInfo.inl) and BaseSceneHandler::GetPresentation
  (BaseSceneHandler.inl).
- SHOnlineInvitePreview.cpp includes GetFriendManager (GameInfo.inl),
  BaseSceneHandler::GetPresentation and the InlineHasher constructors
  (feInlineHasher.h).
- SHOnlineInvitePlayers.cpp includes GetFriendManager.

